## DeskHelper Pro is now XHelpers Pro

This update moves you to **XHelpers Pro** — the same app under a new name. It
installs XHelpers Pro, brings your settings and Secure Pocket with you, and
retires DeskHelper Pro automatically. No re-purchase and no reconfiguration.

After it finishes, XHelpers Pro opens on its own and future updates arrive
through XHelpers Pro.

